sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Diagramme d'Interaction des Classes Internes : Auth & Identity Service

    participant Ctrl as AuthController
    participant Svc as AuthService
    participant UserEnt as User (Entity)
    participant Repo as UserRepository
    participant GamifClient as GamificationRestClient
    participant EventPub as RabbitMQEventPublisher
    participant EventSub as AbuseEventConsumer

    Note over Ctrl,EventPub: Scénario 1 : Inscription (Interaction Synchrone REST & Publication)
    Ctrl->>Svc: register(RegisterRequestDto)
    Svc->>UserEnt: new User(email, hashPassword(password), role)
    Svc->>Repo: save(user)
    Repo-->>Svc: User persisted (userId)
    Svc->>GamifClient: createProfile(userId, initialXP=0) [REST Synchrone]
    GamifClient-->>Svc: 201 Created
    Svc->>EventPub: publishUserRegisteredEvent(user) [RabbitMQ]
    Svc-->>Ctrl: AuthResponseDto(jwtToken, userId)

    Note over EventSub,Repo: Scénario 2 : Signalement Abus (Consommation Asynchrone)
    EventSub->>Svc: handleUserReportedAbuse(UserReportedAbuseEvent)
    Svc->>Repo: findById(targetUserId)
    Repo-->>Svc: User
    Svc->>UserEnt: deactivateAccount() (isActive = false)
    Svc->>Repo: save(user)
